flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Garment photo uploaded]
    B --> C[Classify texture with DTD ResNet-50]
    C --> D[Take top class and top-3 probabilities]
    D --> E[Retrieve descriptor for the class]
    E --> F[Encode on/off patterns with a 10 ms tick]
    F --> G[Score fidelity of each pattern]
    G --> H[Show waveform, spectrum and fidelity]
    H --> I{Can this browser vibrate?}
    I -->|No: iOS or desktop| J[Show waveform and spectrum only]
    I -->|Yes: Android| K{Compare mode on?}
    K -->|No| L[Play pattern with navigator.vibrate]
    K -->|Yes| M[Load second fabric and play both in turn]
    M --> L
    L --> N[Log device model and latency]
    J --> O([End])
    N --> O
